{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120575","id":3919484228,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7pnpVE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120575","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120575.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120575.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120575","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120575/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120575/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120575/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0e348d1f32a45c938aa49713692df3b7fdbbe34b","number":120575,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix editor language selection for multiple languages","user":{"login":"sarcengm","id":4984388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5ODQzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4984388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarcengm","html_url":"https://github.com/sarcengm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarcengm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarcengm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarcengm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarcengm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarcengm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarcengm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarcengm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarcengm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarcengm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes the language selection list and auto language selection when you have multiple languages.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI updated Godot recently and the launcher suddenly turned Japanese. In windows I have my language set to English with as second language Japanese. Previously it auto selected English as it should have.\r\n\r\nRecently a feature was introduced (https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/06aa8042c29563130cdddea9ff4fa5b05351bf38) where it now selects the best language from all supported languages. But it introduced two bugs. \r\n\r\n\r\n* get_editor_locales() only includes translations, it doesn't include \"en\", so if you have a matching language other then English, it will never pick English, even if English is your first language choice.\r\n* the lang_hint string was being built in the same loop that tries to find the best language, so for every language that doesn't match a translation it will add the lang_hint. In my case with English and Japanese as languages it duplicated the choice list twice, but it would duplicate it more times if I had more langues it couldn't find.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"arch